# Engineering

- Agent commits include: `Co-authored-by: lazehang <lazehang@gmail.com>`
- Run existing quality gates: `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test` (package scripts; often `node --test` under workers).
- Prefer existing patterns in the touched package; avoid drive-by refactors.
- Do **not** invent product decisions — escalate to maintainers.
- Do **not** claim production-ready.
- License is **MIT** — root `LICENSE` must exist and stay honest with `package.json`.
- Only commit / push / open PRs when the human explicitly asks.
